            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A shore? (કિનારો.) A waterfall? (ધોધ.) A cave? (ગુફા.) A valley? (ખીણ.) A hill? (ટેકરી.) A desert? (રણ.) Lightning? (વીજળી.) A storm? (તોફાન.) The earth? (ધરતી.) Moonlight? (ચાંદની.) Darkness? (અંધારું.) Light? (પ્રકાશ.) Shade? (છાંયો.) A rabbit? (સસલું.) A deer? (હરણ.) A bear? (રીંછ.) A jackal? (શિયાળ.) A wolf? (વરુ.) A pigeon? (કબૂતર.) A duck? (બતક.)"
